      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TARAWI MALIBU (1) is drawn well on the inside. Latest effort finished 4th over 525m at Taree Super Track beaten 12 lengths (30.78) behind Flash Ethics in a Grade 4/5 on November 18. Looks well placed here and rates a key player. Expected to be in the finish. EXTREME BLUE (7) boasts a consistent overall record including eight wins from 20 starts, the latest winning (17.35) over 300m at Taree Super Track. Form here is sound including three wins. Meets a moderate line up and should run well. LISA'S VOGUE (4) turned spotting a big start finishing seventh (23.13) last time in a NG at Gosford. Safe beginner but has a tricky box to overcome. Shapes as one to consider. SMOOTH WHITE (2) profiles nicely here at this trip.",
